s highly educated, she doesn't have any hobbies, and is always bored. She doesn't like playboys, so she refuses everything and has never dated a man."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64950"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法の国・ロマランドから召喚された魔女ッ娘の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家の生まれで、悠々自適に暮らしてきた生粋のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ワガママで、プライドも高く、さらに気分屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、兄弟のいない一人っ子である彼女は、内心は寂しく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美貌と教養の高雅さを併せ持つ彼女は、一般の男性からは「高嶺の花」と敬遠され、アプローチされるのは上流階級のプレイボーイばかり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"遊び人が嫌いな彼女は、未だ男性と交際経験がない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18009","sourceWorkId":"10929","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"プライドの高い気分屋だが、背に腹は変えられずイヤイヤ主人公の言いなりに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもツンツンしているが、実はスリスリなでられるのが好きらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"召喚系の魔法が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名門の家で、悠々自適に暮らしているお嬢さま。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教養は高いがこれといって趣味が持てず、いつも退屈している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高齢の父母の間にできた一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ワガママに育ったが、兄弟がいないので内心とても寂しく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を導いてくれる素敵な男性がどこかにいないかといつも考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性にはモテるが、彼女自身がいわゆる「高嶺の花」なので声をかけてくるのは上流階級のプレイボーイばかり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"遊び人は嫌いなので全て断り男性と付き合ったことがない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"199508"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"96 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18009","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"164 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18009","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18009","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18009","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e82e7930572722676b521aa366c00a56071897b25af673caafd63589c1942577.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e302e594a72870c7c29c7659a9e3ca967fb2f3eaa29b3e2052e63ab0cc28f7c.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葉月るい","creatorId":"vndb:s7810","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7810","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7810","name":"葉月るい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224288:199508:92722:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c64951","characterName":"メグ・エイヴァリー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"199509","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224288"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18010"],"vndbCharacterId":"c64951"},"originalCharacterName":"メグ・エイヴァリー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a strong inquisitive mind and tends to want to challenge the unknown. She specializes in flying magic, especially airborne. She comes from a middle-class family and is the spoiled youngest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64951"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法の国・ロマランドから召喚された魔女ッ娘の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寂しがり屋で、おっちょこちょい、何を考えているのかわからない不思議ちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"探究心が強く、未知なるものへのチャレンジ精神旺盛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元の世界では、マジカル・コレージュ（魔法の国における大学）に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"専攻は、魔法を使った料理だが、成績はよろしくない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分中心に、甘やかされて育った彼女は、学園ではその他大勢の一人という状況に違和感を覚え、何かと注目されるような行動を取っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性に人気はあるが、付き合う対象とはされていないようで、交際経験はない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18010","sourceWorkId":"10929","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく淋しがり屋でおまけにおっちょこちょいの不思議ちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何を考えているか良く分らないが、可愛い動作やポーズなどを研究しているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"探究心が強く、未知のものにチャレンジしたくなる性分で、徐々にマニアックな快感の虜になっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛行系の魔法、とくに空中浮遊が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マジカル・コレージュ（魔法の国における大学）の学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"専攻は（魔法を使った）料理関係だが、成績はイマイチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中流家庭で、甘やかされて育った末っ子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"就学年齢になり学園に行ってみると、「なぜ自分が中心ではないのだろう？」という違和感を抱き、それを埋めるためにいろいろとおかしなことをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性に人気はあるが、不思議ちゃんなので「つきあうよりも、遠目に観賞してるほうがいい」というスタンスに置かれていて、男性と付き合ったことがない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"199509"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18010","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18010","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18010","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18010","sourceWorkId":"10929","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89598fb8266099ee2a4c304966ab7953cbc257d716d217a054eeb320dba56e0e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d204b02076c1456a4b9e023d411bb4ba6b64eee2a21e8b85332db8c3b0816be2.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田依子","creatorId":"vndb:s797","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s797","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s797","name":"永田依子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224288:199509:5104:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64949","characterName":"ルナ・リュミエール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64949"},"originalCharacterName":"ルナ・リュミエール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"With a devoted personality, she always wants to help someone. She is obedient and takes care of the main character. She seems very happy to be praised. He specializes in clone magic, which is useful when you don't have enough hands in an emergency. In a magical country, she works as a healer (nurse) in a hospital. She was born into a poor family, but grew up to be a good girl who loved to help. She's popular with men, but she never dated because she didn't feel \"fated\" with anyone she approached."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64949"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a012266710f7e8db60e63866f4868a849a7ed6f13abfc9f2ded9b8927e58efbf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4e0978f68b6ea70bc0a41c028c1e8a150517dc237648ef5970447b650cdc6f6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName